---
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="pt-12 sm:pt-16">
  <h1
    class="reveal reveal-1 max-w-[34ch] text-[1.7rem] leading-[1.2] sm:text-[2rem]"
  >
    i like building things people actually talk about.
  </h1>

  <div class="reveal reveal-2 body mt-6 max-w-[40rem] space-y-4 text-[1.08rem]">
    <p class="text-muted">
      i'm head of growth at <a
        href="https://ditto.ai"
        class="link-accent"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">ditto</a
      >, a consumer social and matchmaking company. on any given day that looks
      like launching
      a product, planning a campaign, running an event, making a slightly
      unhinged internet post, testing an onboarding flow, or building a website
      for an idea we had that morning.
    </p>

    <p class="text-muted">
      i started on the creative side of the internet — making content, studying
      attention, learning how ideas spread. now i'm learning to build the
      products behind it.
    </p>

    <p class="text-muted">
      currently into consumer social, dating, internet culture, product growth,
      ai tools, and the gap between what people say they want and what they
      actually use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <SocialLinks class="reveal reveal-3 mt-7" />
</section>
